# Process Handoff Note — EPQ / DIR Exception Queue Pipeline
## Context: US-125266

This explains the end-to-end flow this ticket's fixes live inside, every table involved, and
exactly where the two fixes (and the two extra bugs found) sit in that flow. Scope note at the
bottom marks what's verified in detail vs. known-but-not-fully-traced.

---

## 1. Business purpose

A nightly SQL Agent job scans every loan's property tax calendar. When a tax installment becomes
overdue, it creates a "research task" (an **Exception Queue** item) so a tax analyst can follow up.
There are 3 kinds of task (`SystemCode`): **DIR** (Delinquent Installment Research — this ticket's
focus), **DMU** (Delinquency Monthly Updates), **TSP** (Tax Sale Procurement).

---

## 2. Entry point

SQL Server Agent job **`LAS_ExceptionProcessQueue_DataImportNew`** → calls stored procedure
**`[LASTax].[dbo].[usp_ExceptionQueue_DataImportNew]`** (no parameters). That procedure calls
**`[LASTax].[dbo].[usp_ExceptionQueue_DataImportNewIU]`** once per eligible system code, per staging row.

---

## 3. End-to-end flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[SQL Agent job runs] --> B[usp_ExceptionQueue_DataImportNew]
    B --> C["Build #tbl_DLQ_Installment_Research<br/>(pivot lais_PayeeCalendar ELD dates,<br/>apply 20-60 day catch-up window - Gap 1)"]
    C --> D["Truncate + repopulate tbl_ExceptionQueue_Staging<br/>(join Lat_LienMasterKey, lat_ContractMasterKey,<br/>tbl_ExceptionQueue_Assign_ExceptionService,<br/>lac_CustomerProfile, lac_AgencyProfile)"]
    D --> E[Cursor over every staging row]
    E --> F{CancelCode = 'C'?}
    F -->|Yes| G[usp_ExceptionQueue_AutoCompleted_Upd<br/>- separate auto-close path]
    F -->|No| H["Eligibility check: does agency have an<br/>installment matching ES config AND<br/>CurrentTaxYear = agency's CURRENT_TAX_YEAR? - Gap 2"]
    H -->|Yes| I["Pull @DIRTaxYear/@DIRInstallmentNo/@DIRDueDate<br/>- scoped to CurrentTaxYear = CURRENT_TAX_YEAR<br/>(fixed 11/11, was non-deterministic)"]
    I --> J[EXEC usp_ExceptionQueue_DataImportNewIU<br/>once per DIR/DMU/TSP flag that fired]
    J --> K["Dedup guard (US-120627 + 11/10 fix):<br/>does an OPEN record already exist for this<br/>exact LoanID+AgencyID+TaxID+PropertyID+LienSEQ<br/>+SystemCode+TaxYear+InstallmentNo?"]
    K -->|Yes, due date changed, DIR only| L[Carve-out: update in place,<br/>audit note, RETURN]
    K -->|Yes, no change| M[Suppress: log to DedupLog, RETURN]
    K -->|No match| N["Legacy exact-match check on<br/>tbl_ExceptionQueue itself<br/>(TaxYear+InstallmentNo+Lender+Cust+Contract+...)"]
    N -->|Exists, any completion status| O[Archive old row, update wide columns<br/>in place - legacy path, not modified this ticket]
    N -->|Does not exist| P[Insert brand-new ExceptionQueue /<br/>UserTracking / Tax_Info rows - not traced<br/>line-by-line this session]
```

